/**
 * Brand marks that lucide does not ship, inlined as SVG React components.
 *
 * These are generated from the official assets; see each component's note.
 * Pass a Tailwind size/text class to place one, e.g.
 * `<CloudflareLockup className="h-3.5 w-auto" />`.
 *
 * Most of them are hard-coded to `currentColor` so they inherit the surrounding
 * text colour: the upstream files carry their own palettes (Cloudflare's
 * wordmark is #404041, EdgeOne's is #202C40) which would vanish entirely on the
 * dark theme. See the generator notes for why the Travellings badge is the
 * exception.
 */

